# Write clear titles

<h2 id="wg-030">Name the action and its object</h2>

Start a control label with a verb and say what it affects. Use sentence case.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Submit | Save schedule |
| On | Turn on reading lamp |

<h2 id="keep-titles-short">Keep titles short</h2>

Aim for 65 characters or fewer, without dropping the room name.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Hallway motion sensor battery level and connection status for the ground floor | Hallway motion sensor status |

<h2 id="make-titles-unique">Make titles unique</h2>

Give repeated titles different names.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Settings, Settings | Lounge lamp settings, Hallway lamp settings |

<h2 id="describe-the-content">Describe the content</h2>

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Information | Hallway motion sensor battery |

<h2 id="avoid-repeating-yourself">Avoid saying the same thing twice</h2>

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Heating: heating schedule | Heating schedule |

<h2 id="leave-out-the-content-type">Leave out the content type</h2>

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Card: Energy usage | Energy usage |
